toregressive generation and presents it as a genomic foundation model. It also reports fine-tuning across many benchmark tasks, supporting foundation-model evidence.","evidence_snippet":"\"120M-parameter hierarchical genomic foundation model\" and \"adapts H-Net-style dynamic chunking from autoregressive generation\""},{"record_id":"rec_000184","paper_type":"application_wrapper","generative_model_present":"unclear","foundation_model_evidence":"unclear","primary_exclusion_code":"application_wrapper","uncertainty_reason":"foundation_model_evidence_unclear","decision_rationale":"The abstract describes an AI agent that turns natural language into analyses and plots on top of the CoMMpass dataset. It does not provide evidence of a new generative foundation model.","evidence_snippet":"\"We developed MyeGPT, an AI agent\" and \"converts natural language into de novo analyses\""}]}
