5","paper_type":"unclear","generative_model_present":"no","foundation_model_evidence":"no","primary_exclusion_code":"EC3_not_generative","uncertainty_reason":"paper_type_unclear","decision_rationale":"The abstract describes a spatial transcriptomics/scRNA-seq biology study and validation of cell states, not a generative model. It does not provide foundation-model evidence.","evidence_snippet":"\"We describe the use of true single-cell resolution spatial transcriptomics\"; \"identify and localize key transcriptional programs in situ\""},{"record_id":"rec_000096","paper_type":"primary_model_paper","generative_model_present":"no","foundation_model_evidence":"no","primary_exclusion_code":"EC3_not_generative","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"SI-SimCLR is a self-supervised representation-learning framework for reconstructing phenotypic landscapes, but the abstract does not describe a generative model. It also lacks evidence of foundation-model-style pretraining or broad transfer.","evidence_snippet":"\"self-supervised learning framework\"; \"learns biologically informative representations\"; \"enables reconstruction of cellular phenotypic landscapes\""}]}
