./data/screening_codex_full_2026-07-06/role_logs/scope_reviewer/batch_0224.stderr.log:1604:./data/screening_codex_2026-06-10/role_logs/adjudicator/batch_0003.stderr.log:1828:./data/screening_codex_2026-06-10/role_logs/architecture_reviewer/batch_0033.stderr.log:2206:./data/screening_codex_2026-06-10/role_logs/architecture_reviewer/batch_0009.stderr.log:136:{"results":[{"record_id":"rec_000065","paper_type":"primary_model_paper","generative_model_present":"no","foundation_model_evidence":"unclear","primary_exclusion_code":"EC3_not_generative","uncertainty_reason":"foundation_model_evidence_unclear","decision_rationale":"The abstract describes predictive variant-pathogenicity classification with embedding/transformer features, not a genuinely generative architecture. It mentions Prot-BERT and transformer-based methods, but not broad pretraining or foundation-model-like transfer evidence.","evidence_snippet":"\"predicting the pathogenicity ... using amino acid sequence representations\"; \"Feedforward, Conv1D, BiLSTM, Transformer, and Prot-BERT were evaluated\""},{"record_id":"rec_000066","paper_type":"review_editorial","generative_model_present":"no","foundation_model_evidence":"no","primary_exclusion_code":"review_editorial","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"This is a review summarizing AI applications in Baijiu research, not an original model paper. It does not describe a generative model or provide foundation-model evidence.","evidence_snippet":"\"This review systematically summarizes the current state of AI applications\""},{"record_id":"rec_000067","paper_type":"review_editorial","generative_model_present":"no","foundation_model_evidence":"no","primary_exclusion_code":"review_editorial","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"The abstract explicitly says this is a review of current evidence and future directions. It mentions multimodal foundation models only as an emerging trend, not as a candidate model in the paper.","evidence_snippet":"\"This review of the current evidence\"; \"including multimodal foundation models\""},{"record_id":"rec_000068","paper_type":"review_editorial","generative_model_present":"no","foundation_model_evidence":"no","primary_exclusion_code":"review_editorial","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"This is a complete review of ac4C site prediction methods. The abstract discusses LLM-based techniques as reviewed approaches, not as a generative candidate model with foundation-model evidence.","evidence_snippet":"\"a complete review\"; \"ML, DL, and LLM-based techniques ... has been evaluated and contrasted in this review\""},{"record_id":"rec_000069","paper_type":"primary_model_paper","generative_model_present":"no","foundation_model_evidence":"unclear","primary_exclusion_code":"EC3_not_generative","uncertainty_reason":"foundation_model_evidence_unclear","decision_rationale":"The model is a Transformer framework for GRN inference and reconstruction, which is predictive rather than generative. The abstract does not establish broad pretraining or other foundation-model-like characteristics.","evidence_snippet":"\"reconstructs GRNs\"; \"a prior-guided multi-omic Transformer framework\""},{"record_id":"rec_000070","paper_type":"primary_model_paper","generative_model_present":"no","foundation_model_evidence":"no","primary_exclusion_code":"EC3_not_generative","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"SMART is a transfer-learning method for multi-task linear regression, not a generative model. The abstract describes spectral transfer and predictive estimation, with no foundation-model evidence.","evidence_snippet":"\"for multi-task linear regression\"; \"structured regularization that incorporates spectral information from a source study\""},{"record_id":"rec_000071","paper_type":"review_editorial","generative_model_present":"no","foundation_model_evidence":"no","primary_exclusion_code":"review_editorial","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"This is a comprehensive review of AI tools for variant calling, not an original generative model paper. The abstract lists existing tools and future directions rather than a foundation model.","evidence_snippet":"\"The present review attempts to give a broad overview\"; \"major AI-based tools such as DeepVariant...\""},{"record_id":"rec_000072","paper_type":"primary_model_paper","generative_model_present":"yes","foundation_model_evidence":"yes","primary_exclusion_code":"none","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"The abstract explicitly describes a \"deep generative decoder model\". It also reports a shared latent representation and cross-dataset generalization, which support foundation-model-like transferability.","evidence_snippet":"\"a deep generative decoder model\"; \"learned a shared latent representation\"; \"improved cross-dataset generalization\""}]}
