vidence_snippet":"\"integrating a pretrained protein-language model and gene weights\" to \"establish a prediction algorithm\"."},{"record_id":"rec_000064","paper_type":"review_editorial","generative_model_present":"no","foundation_model_evidence":"no","primary_exclusion_code":"review_editorial","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"This is a review of emerging multimodal models and AI foundation models in epilepsy, not a primary generative model paper. The abstract summarizes examples and challenges rather than introducing a model.","evidence_snippet":"\"In this review, we summarise\" and \"We describe AI foundation models\"."}]}
