certainty_reason":"mixed_signals","decision_rationale":"The title and venue suggest a review-style article, while the abstract snippet mentions a specific generative approach and GPT framework. The record is ambiguous, but it does not clearly establish a primary text-bio model paper.","evidence_snippet":"title \"Target identification and assessment in the era of AI\"; abstract snippet mentions \"pretraining adheres to the standard GPT framework\""},{"record_id":"rec_000328","paper_type":"review_editorial","bio_modality_present":"yes","text_component_present":"yes","text_bio_bridge_present":"no","primary_exclusion_code":"review_editorial","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"This is explicitly a scoping review of AI applications in dermatology education and research. It mentions both LLMs/NLP and dermatology data uses, but as a review rather than a primary candidate model paper.","evidence_snippet":"\"This scoping review synthesized current applications\"; \"machine learning, natural language processing, and generative artificial intelligence in dermatology\""}]}
