t clearly describe a generative model paper.","evidence_snippet":"\"Comprehensive literature review\"; \"Foundation models unlock analysis of unstructured electronic health record data at scale\""},{"record_id":"rec_000182","paper_type":"primary_model_paper","bio_modality_present":"yes","text_component_present":"no","text_bio_bridge_present":"no","generative_model_present":"no","foundation_model_evidence":"yes","primary_exclusion_code":"EC2_no_text_component","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"This is an interpretability study of a pre-trained genomic language model, not a text-bio model. The record supports a foundation model but no natural-language text component or substantive text-bio bridge.","evidence_snippet":"\"Pre-trained genomic language model (gLM) representations\"; \"Nucleotide Transformer v2 (500M)\""},{"record_id":"rec_000184","paper_type":"application_wrapper","bio_modality_present":"yes","text_component_present":"yes","text_bio_bridge_present":"no","generative_model_present":"unclear","foundation_model_evidence":"unclear","primary_exclusion_code":"application_wrapper","uncertainty_reason":"foundation_model_evidence_unclear","decision_rationale":"MyeGPT is described as an agent that turns natural language into analyses on an existing dataset, which is wrapper-style usage rather than a new foundation model. The abstract does not clearly identify the underlying model.","evidence_snippet":"\"converts natural language into de novo analyses\"; \"We deploy the agent as a ready-to-use browser application\""},{"record_id":"rec_000187","paper_type":"review_editorial","bio_modality_present":"yes","text_component_present":"no","text_bio_bridge_present":"no","generative_model_present":"no","foundation_model_evidence":"no","primary_exclusion_code":"review_editorial","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"The title signals a review-style article on AI-integrated multi-omics in breast cancer, with no abstract text describing a primary model. No text-bio bridge or foundation-model evidence is stated.","evidence_snippet":"\"opportunities, challenges, and future perspectives\""}]}
