ons as an interactive assistant\""},{"record_id":"rec_000337","paper_type":"application_wrapper","bio_modality_present":"yes","text_component_present":"no","text_bio_bridge_present":"no","generative_model_present":"no","foundation_model_evidence":"no","primary_exclusion_code":"application_wrapper","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"This is a multi-agent framework for executing and refining bioinformatics workflows, not a generative text-bio model. The abstract emphasizes orchestration, troubleshooting, and reproducible execution.","evidence_snippet":"\"multi-agent framework\"; \"iteratively execute, troubleshoot, and refine bioinformatics workflows\""},{"record_id":"rec_000338","paper_type":"review_editorial","bio_modality_present":"yes","text_component_present":"yes","text_bio_bridge_present":"no","generative_model_present":"unclear","foundation_model_evidence":"unclear","primary_exclusion_code":"review_editorial","uncertainty_reason":"mixed_signals","decision_rationale":"This is a review/chapter on AI in cancer precision medicine, not a primary model paper. The abstract mentions GPT-4 and cell type annotation as examples rather than a new text-bio model.","evidence_snippet":"\"The Emerging Role of Artificial Intelligence in Advancing Molecular Precision Medicine for Cancer\"; \"GPT-4 enabled semi- or fully automated cell type annotation\""},{"record_id":"rec_000339","paper_type":"benchmark_resource","bio_modality_present":"yes","text_component_present":"yes","text_bio_bridge_present":"yes","generative_model_present":"unclear","foundation_model_evidence":"unclear","primary_exclusion_code":"benchmark_resource","uncertainty_reason":"generative_status_unclear","decision_rationale":"The title explicitly frames this as benchmarking LLM agents on multimodal biomedical tasks, so it is a benchmark/resource paper rather than a new model. It evaluates existing models instead of introducing a primary text-bio foundation model.","evidence_snippet":"\"Benchmarking LLM Agents on Multi-Modal Biomedical Machine Learning Tasks\""}]}
